    <preface>
      <p>International Tax Agreements Amendment Act 2013</p>
      <p>No. 14, 2013</p>
      <p>An Act to amend the law relating to taxation, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>Contents</p>
      <p>1	Short title	1</p>
      <p>2	Commencement	2</p>
      <p>3	Schedule(s)	2</p>
      <p>Schedule 1—Amendments	3</p>
      <p><ref href="#part-1">Part 1</ref>—New agreements	3</p>
